    "traits": "Consumable Herb",
    "description": "<strong>Usage held in 1 hand; Activate Interact (2 AP).</strong>\n\nTerrain: temperate or cold thickets.\n\nNeedleberry bushes protect their fruit with long, glassy thorns and grow most thickly along wind-scoured ridges. The narrow crimson berries end in hard points, making them painful to harvest without heavy gloves. Hunters preserve them in brine; bitten whole, they taste strongly of iron and produce a brief, intense steadiness in the hands and eyes. For 3 rounds, you gain a +1-item bonus to ranged weapon attack rolls.\n\nPillars of Faith, Chapter 6.",
